This is just the beginning. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Who knows what other monsters we'll encounter here?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":6,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm so going to overthink whenever I have to shoot Paradeus units from now on..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Think of it as setting them free from this wretched existence. That should take the weight off your conscience. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And that's precisely what we're doing. Of course, you could ask their opinions if you could return their brains to normal."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":6,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Eeek... I think I'll pass."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not picking up any signals nearby."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We'll be heading into a signal dead zone from here on in."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's a lot like that jamming system in Tallinn used by the Isomers."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":6,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can't believe they're jamming in such a large radius..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G11","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This feels like a good place for a nap."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gr G11 leans against one of those miniature devices which seem to be everywhere and sleepily rubs her eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Could you sleep on your box instead? Why do you have to sleep on this?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":6,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now that you mention it, what the hell are these devices for? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They're everywhere... And they don't look like emergency lights to me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Let's open them up and find out."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"UMP45 puts down her gun and walks up to Gr G11, where she opens the casing of the small device. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Thus exposed, the device reveals a dense network of circuitry."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...This is definitely not what you'd find in emergency lighting. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I've never seen circuitry like this before."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let me see."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh... You're right, this IS new... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How does it work?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Wait a minute."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"UMP45 brings it up to her face and studies it closely."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Look at this part—doesn't it look like one of those Nyto inhibitors we saw in the sub base?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait a minute... Don't tell me..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So this is an enhanced version of that? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ah, I got it! This dev board over here...is an amplifier. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's emitting a suppression signal!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So did Paradeus scatter these things all over to jam our comms?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"UMP45 narrows her eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They were never meant to jam our comms. Actually, I don't think they care at all whether we can use our comms. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"These things...were designed to muzzle \"a specific person\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"UMP9's and 416's eyes widen in alarm as the realization sinks in."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't mean..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not being able to send or receive signals or running with comms offline is no big deal for us. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At most, it would mildly affect our combat effectiveness and coordination. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They wouldn't have invested all these resources just to do that. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But there is someone...who becomes as useless as a brick if she can't connect to networks."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Miss Dandelion?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They're going after Dandelion!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We need to move fast. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If this net is meant to catch that little lady, then all our previous intel is unreliable. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"416, hook Gr G11 up. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...The ambush forces here are probably even more outrageous than you can imagine."}]}]}]}
